# Obsidian per-machine / volatile state — keep out of Git.
# The `**/` prefix matches a `.obsidian/` folder at any depth, so this works
# whether the vault root is `docs/` or `docs/project-management/`.
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache/
**/.trash/

# Shareable Obsidian config (app.json, appearance.json, hotkeys, community
# plugin settings) is intentionally tracked so the vault setup travels with the
# repo. Add `**/.obsidian/` here if you'd rather keep all editor settings local.
